# react-select

Do **not** set these props on any `react-select` instance:

- `menuPortalTarget`
- `menuPosition="fixed"`

They break selection / interaction in this project. The default in-place menu works correctly (including inside dialogs).

```tsx
// ❌ BAD
<Select
  menuPortalTarget={document.body}
  menuPosition="fixed"
  ...
/>

// ✅ GOOD
<Select
  options={options}
  value={value}
  onChange={onChange}
  ...
/>
```

Also omit unused `menuPortal` style overrides when not portaling.
